Subject: [PATCH 112/190] dt-bindings: iio: adc: versal-sysmon: fix
 io-channel-cells

commit a43854f9d9e04234a25bf839da8d781d597069b9 from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

The io-channel cells is changed to 1 for AIE thermal monitoring addition.
This was not updated in the bindings. This patch fixes the issue.

Signed-off-by: Anish Kadamathikuttiyil Karthikeyan Pillai <anish.kadamathikuttiyil-karthikeyan-pillai@amd.com>
Message-ID: <20250922005328.312582-1-anish.kadamathikuttiyil-karthikeyan-pillai@amd.com>
State: pending
Signed-off-by: Quanyang Wang <quanyang.wang@windriver.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
